test/check/error-reaction.sumspec:15:13:
   |
15 | core.toggle core.Title#t :: Mode.On -> Mode.Off
   |             ^
the input of core.toggle is a core.TodoId; write core.TodoId or leave the input out

test/check/error-reaction.sumspec:16:11:
   |
16 | core.stop core.TodoId#id :: Mode.On -> Mode.Off
   |           ^
core.stop takes no input; leave it out

test/check/error-reaction.sumspec:17:39:
   |
17 | core.clear :: Mode.On -> Mode.Off  >> core.stop
   |                                       ^
a reaction fires nothing: it happens with core.clear, which fires it already

